`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:["A ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Roots"})," blower is a pump: it displaces a fixed volume per turn, so its pressure ratio is roughly flat with engine speed. Measured on a 6.2 V8, it made ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"+33% torque over naturally aspirated at 1,500 rpm"})," where the as-sized centrifugal made ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"+4%"}),"."]}),`
