`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:["The two torque curves crossed at ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"≈4,660 rpm"}),". Below that the pump wins; above it the fan does."]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:["The centrifugal's top-end win is ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"not"})," its pressure law. Re-run with the Roots' efficiency and boost cap, the centrifugal peaked at ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"510 hp"})," — losing everywhere. It wins at the top because it compresses more efficiently, which earns it a higher knock ceiling."]}),`
