`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Forced induction is sized, not calibrated."})," A turbo or blower can be fitted to the rotary, sized by the same law as the piston engines', but no preset is checked against a real turbocharged rotary. The Vision X-Coupe's two-rotor rotary ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"turbo"}),", the newest engine in this article, is outside what the model can claim to represent."]}),`
