`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turbocharger",children:"Wikipedia, Turbocharger"}),": a compressor driven by a turbine in the exhaust stream (retrieved 2026-09-11)"]}),`
